I'll choose figures such as Napoleon Bonaparte, Frida Kahlo, and Albert Einstein as my guests for my dinner party. I'll parachute down to their locations, whenever I can."

The exact settings are revealed. Two areas with unique themes and settings are set up. Napoleon is standing at a rough old, cobbled square with gardens. The September sky over Vienna is transporting. Frida is in a new building modeled by her sister Mildred, large and modern, also full of artwork.

"I am thrilled that I get to travel to the continent for my special dinner party," I decide.

